OL,3,GNEWSAPC lied about crash visit and went
OL,4,Ato McDonald's
OL,5,
OL,6,FA police officer lied about knocking on
OL,7,Fthe door of a man who reported a car
OL,8,Fcrash in his street, then headed to
OL,9,FMcDonald's restaurant, a misconduct
OL,10,Fpanel has heard.
OL,12,FFormer Leicestershire Police officer
OL,13,FEmma Elliott was the subject of a
OL,14,Fmisconduct hearing on Tuesday after
OL,15,FRing doorbell footage showed she did
OL,16,Fnot knock on the door of a man who had
OL,17,Fphoned police on 17 October 2025.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
