OL,3,GNEWSAPC lied about crash visit and went
OL,4,Ato McDonald's
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn mitigation, the panel heard that
OL,7,FElliott was aged 18 at the time and had
OL,8,Fearned independent patrol status just
OL,9,Fmonths before in June. She was still on
OL,10,Fprobation at the time.
OL,12,FThe panel concluded that her actions
OL,13,Famounted to gross misconduct and said
OL,14,Fshe would have been sacked if she had
OL,15,Fnot already resigned.
